{"seq":55,"slug":"computer-vision-applied","title":"计算机视觉工程应用","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"计算机视觉工程应用\">计算机视觉工程应用</h1><p>计算机视觉在 2026 年已从学术研究走向大规模工业部署。YOLO 系列迭代至 v11，SAM 2 将交互式分割从静态图像扩展到视频流，Stable Diffusion 3 用 MMDiT 架构重新定义了多模态生成，而 GPT-4o、Gemini 2.5 等视觉语言模型（VLM）让&quot;看懂并说出来&quot;变为基础能力。这些进展不再只是论文指标上的提升——它们正在驱动自动驾驶感知、工业缺陷检测、医学影像辅助诊断、内容生成平台等真实产品。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦&quot;工程应用&quot;视角：不追求推导每个公式的数学完备性，而是帮助有 3-7 年经验的开发者理解核心架构为什么有效、工程上如何落地、以及系统层面的设计取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的分工\">与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>NLP 与 Transformer</strong>（<code>53_nlp-transformers</code>）：覆盖注意力机制、预训练范式、多模态 Transformer 的通用理论。本 hub 在视觉分支上引用其基础，但专注于 CV 特有的骨干网络、检测/分割/生成任务与部署约束。</li>\n<li><strong>LLM 微调</strong>（<code>49_llm-fine-tuning</code>）：覆盖 LoRA/QLoRA、DPO 等参数高效方法。本 hub 涉及视觉模型微调（如 SAM 2 的 prompt-tuning、VLM 的视觉对齐训练）时引用其方法论，但不重复通用微调流程。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>路径 A — 检测/分割工程师</strong>：foundations → detection → deployment，可跳过 generation。</p>\n<p><strong>路径 B — 生成/多模态工程师</strong>：foundations → generation → deployment，detection 选读。</p>\n<p><strong>路径 C — 全栈 CV 工程师</strong>：按章节顺序完整阅读。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>深度学习基础（反向传播、SGD、CNN 卷积操作）</li>\n<li>Python + PyTorch 基本使用</li>\n<li>了解 Transformer 自注意力机制（可先阅读 <code>53_nlp-transformers/1_foundations/1_attention-mechanism.md</code>）</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"视觉基础与工程骨架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cnn-feature-extraction","title":"CNN 特征提取与骨干网络演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/foundations/cnn-feature-extraction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vision-transformer","title":"Vision Transformer 架构与工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/foundations/vision-transformer"},{"seq":3,"slug":"training-pipeline","title":"数据工程与训练流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/foundations/training-pipeline"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"detection","title":"检测与分割工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/detection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"yolo-evolution","title":"YOLO 系列演进与 YOLOv11 工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/detection/yolo-evolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sam-segmentation","title":"SAM 2 通用分割模型与工程落地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/detection/sam-segmentation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"3d-vision","title":"三维视觉与点云处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/detection/3d-vision"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"generation","title":"视觉生成与多模态","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/generation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"diffusion-models","title":"扩散模型与 Stable Diffusion 3 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/generation/diffusion-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vision-language-models","title":"视觉语言模型（VLM）工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/generation/vision-language-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"image-editing","title":"图像编辑与可控生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/generation/image-editing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"deployment","title":"部署与工程化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/deployment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"model-optimization","title":"模型压缩与量化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/deployment/model-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"edge-inference","title":"边缘设备推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/deployment/edge-inference"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mlops-cv","title":"CV 系统 MLOps 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/computer-vision-applied/deployment/mlops-cv"}]}]}